--
--  Description:     -- Find intersection of point vector with pipe geometry--
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Methods defined:
--
--  Method call                      Return              Description
--  ===========                      ======              ===========
--  display()                        -                   Draw aids for the point vector representing the P-point
--  impliedTubeIntersection(DBREF,POINTVECTOR) POINTVECTOR         find intersection between a point vector and leave tube of
--  intersection(DBREF,DBREF,STRING) POINTVECTOR         find intersection between point vector derived from
--  intersection(DBREF,POINTVECTOR)  POINTVECTOR         find intersection between given point vector and the specified
--  pipeIntersection()               -                   Constructor
--  tidy()                           -                   Tidy up aids
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
